    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485650/extras/2017f8f0a6c1c5dcdbf45219fcbcefbd.poster.avif?t=1752961071\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485650/extras/2017f8f0a6c1c5dcdbf45219fcbcefbd.apng?t=1752961071\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br>From the creator of Super Amazing Wagon Adventure comes a platformer with a focus on expressive controls. Meet J.Me a happy robot hero of an unfinished game. Everything is going great for J.Me until one day J.Me's disillusioned developer cancels J.Me's game and deletes the  planet. Now J.Me is abandoned in a universe of games. Please help J.Me!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expressive new jump controls</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485650/extras/91193a4bbc58a97350a9e327c513d59e.poster.avif?t=1752961071\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485650/extras/91193a4bbc58a97350a9e327c513d59e.webm?t=1752961071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485650/extras/91193a4bbc58a97350a9e327c513d59e.mp4?t=1752961071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>J.Me has an expressive and intuitive collection of moves including a twirl button and left and right roll buttons for maximum air control. Duck, stretch, dive, spin, and more--or you can just keep pressing jump! Play how you want with a controller or keyboard.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 diverse pixel art worlds: visit First World, Computer World, Bird World, and more!<br></li><li>Bounce off enemies and obstacles inspired by the world of games: checker pieces, pawns, dominos, basketballs, footballs, and much more!<br></li><li>Powerups that alter J.Me's controls and appearance: \ud83d\ude80 Jet Mode, \ud83c\udfc1 Race Mode, and another one I'm keeping secret for now \ud83e\udd2b</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485650/extras/2017f8f0a6c1c5dcdbf45219fcbcefbd.poster.avif?t=1752961071\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485650/extras/2017f8f0a6c1c5dcdbf45219fcbcefbd.apng?t=1752961071\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span><br>From the creator of Super Amazing Wagon Adventure comes a platformer with a focus on expressive controls. Meet J.Me a happy robot hero of an unfinished game. Everything is going great for J.Me until one day J.Me's disillusioned developer cancels J.Me's game and deletes the  planet. Now J.Me is abandoned in a universe of games. Please help J.Me!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expressive new jump controls</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485650/extras/91193a4bbc58a97350a9e327c513d59e.poster.avif?t=1752961071\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485650/extras/91193a4bbc58a97350a9e327c513d59e.webm?t=1752961071\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2485650/extras/91193a4bbc58a97350a9e327c513d59e.mp4?t=1752961071\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>J.Me has an expressive and intuitive collection of moves including a twirl button and left and right roll buttons for maximum air control. Duck, stretch, dive, spin, and more--or you can just keep pressing jump! Play how you want with a controller or keyboard.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>6 diverse pixel art worlds: visit First World, Computer World, Bird World, and more!<br></li><li>Bounce off enemies and obstacles inspired by the world of games: checker pieces, pawns, dominos, basketballs, footballs, and much more!<br></li><li>Powerups that alter J.Me's controls and appearance: \ud83d\ude80 Jet Mode, \ud83c\udfc1 Race Mode, and another one I'm keeping secret for now \ud83e\udd2b</li></ul>",
